sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor W as Anwar (worker)
    participant P as Phone (PWA)
    participant S as Bardan server
    participant M as Bardan Intelligence
    participant G as Guardian
    actor SV as Joseph (supervisor)
    W->>P: Says or types «ما فيني دوخة، بس الماي خلص»
    P->>P: Offline phrase matcher checks for urgent words
    alt urgent symptom words
        P-->>W: Emergency card opens at once, no model or network
    else everything else
        P->>S: Report (text or voice clip)
        S->>M: Intake prompt with no names or IDs
        M-->>S: Intents with the words that support them
        S->>G: Check the draft
        G-->>S: Allowed, and nothing the matcher found is dropped
        S-->>P: "I heard": water finished (yes) · not dizzy (no)
        W->>P: Confirms. Nothing is saved before this
        P->>S: Confirmed report
        S->>S: Policy engine creates WATER_RESTORE (needs E3, start by 09:55)
        S-->>SV: Mandatory task with an owner and a deadline
    end
    Note over P,S: Offline: the report waits in the outbox and sends itself later
